Twist TODO List
================

Done in the current tree
------------------------

  [x] GNU package shape (automake, Libtool, gettext, Texinfo)
  [x] Loop, epoll and kqueue, connection, external driver
  [x] Runtime, storage pool, timers, waker
  [x] quickstep TLS and QUIC, found as an installed library
  [x] Transfer engine: URL, scheme table, easy/multi/share, DNS, cache,
      proxy
  [x] HTTP/1, HTTP/2, HTTP/3, redirects, cookies, Basic, Digest, Bearer
  [x] gzip and deflate request and response coding (zlib)
  [x] CLI streams, exit status, and the curl options those transfers use
  [x] FTP/FTPS, SMTP/SMTPS, IMAP/IMAPS, POP3/POP3S
  [x] MQTT/MQTTS, LDAP/LDAPS, WebSocket, Gopher, DICT, TFTP, FILE
  [x] DoH, and DoQ/DoT when the resolver advertises them

Still to do
-----------

  [ ] TELNET, RTSP
  [ ] SCP/SFTP, SMB/SMBS, RTMP/RTMPS
  [ ] NTLM and Negotiate, only after a dependency decision
  [ ] Brotli.  The coding table can take another name.  Which library,
      and whether a request may use it, is not decided.  Do not
      advertise "br" until it can be decoded.
  [ ] Split tests/test-unit.c by subsystem
  [ ] Integration peers.  make check-integration still skips when no
      peer is configured.  A podman lab is one way to supply the
      servers and is not chosen yet.
  [ ] io_uring poll backend
